{#- The library writes an empty anchor element for every label. Where the label
    named its section, the section already carries it as its id, and writing it
    again would put the same id on the page twice. Kept to one line, and to the
    same line breaks the library uses, so that leaving it out moves nothing. -#}
{{ (sectionIdOfAnchor(node) != node.value ? '<a id="' ~ node.value ~ '"></a>' : '')|raw }}
